<title>RUSSIA: Rouble lower at 5,407 per dlr in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble lower at 5,407 per dlr in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble eased to 5,407 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) from 5,404 on Friday. Dealers said the central bank sold $2.94 million to close trading.</p>
<p>				    Sept 30		 Sept 27</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,407		   5,404</p>
<p> Volume traded (million $)	4.10		    9.74</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
